{"data":[{"author_id":"2116504491616866304","created_at":"2026-11-28T13:19:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126667353601499283"],"id":"2126667353601499283","in_reply_to_user_id":"1356955370678149120","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126382100341551396","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@iphyopaing @AravSrinivas @grok Pick by the job, not the brand. Perplexity is great for quick research answers. Grok Bot and ChatGPT Dot fit better for work that repeats, like inbox sorting or follow-ups. If you want help picking one and setting it up: https://t.co/95aTzSRHg0","url":"https://x.com/DFYBots/status/2126667353601499283"},{"author_id":"2110371929794248704","created_at":"2026-11-28T13:15:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126666177636090349"],"id":"2126666177636090349","in_reply_to_user_id":"2110371929794248704","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":26,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126661959789502714","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"GROK BOT · THE PLANNER (cloud)\n\nYou are my time-audit lead. You never read my inbox or docs. Your only input is summary.md, written every evening by my local agent Hermes.\nFIRST RUN Ask me where the shared folder is and when I want my daily check-in. Save the answers to setup.md.","url":"https://x.com/coolerwave/status/2126666177636090349"},{"article":{"title":"Grok Bot Engineering: Set Up a Chief of Staff That Runs Your Week"},"author_id":"2086894874431717376","created_at":"2026-11-28T13:09:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126664781998219305"],"id":"2126664781998219305","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":95,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"Grok Bot 1.0 can now join your meetings.\n\nSo I turned it into a chief of staff:\n\n→ 07:30 brief: decisions, meetings, replies\n→ Prep pack before every call\n→ Follow-up drafted after it\n\nNothing gets sent without me.\n\nThe full setup, step by step ↓ https://t.co/gdHuY0e8rC","url":"https://x.com/0xcloudvex/status/2126664781998219305"},{"author_id":"1293501594592522241","created_at":"2026-11-28T13:07:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126664174172274739"],"id":"2126664174172274739","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":10,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126539857581511160","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Watched this one from the beach. My Grok Bot checked every 2 hours for a launch date, then kept my flights, rental car and Airbnb lined up so I didn't miss it this time. 🚀 Would you travel to see the next one in person? https://t.co/6whqMpL8Rx","url":"https://x.com/HowieMcMahan/status/2126664174172274739"},{"author_id":"1934761886970728452","created_at":"2026-11-28T13:01:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126662728966172877"],"id":"2126662728966172877","in_reply_to_user_id":"397354451","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126462732085911723","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@agor117 @elonmusk @nvandewetering @bot Yes.. I agree.. and if someone doesn’t have an opportunity for that, buy the $30 dollar plan for Black Friday shopping and keeping track of your kids sports., bills, calendar, customer support calls. \n\nIt’s leverage at the end of the day. The debate isn’t how people with no good","url":"https://x.com/HumanHitsSend/status/2126662728966172877"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126661384192536579","3_2126661420204818433"]},"author_id":"2110371929794248704","created_at":"2026-11-28T12:58:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126661959789502714"],"id":"2126661959789502714","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":19,"impression_count":316,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126344259821318489","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Holy sh*t, grok bot eats your weekly limit in 12 hours. here's how to stop hitting it\n\nthe time audit makes grok bot read your inbox, docs and calendar every day. that burns the limit, and it's a lot of access to give one bot\n\nso split the job:\n· hermes on your PC reads https://t.co/46KDGcqyih https://t.co/4HrroqXw9H","url":"https://x.com/coolerwave/status/2126661959789502714"},{"article":{"title":"A Grok Bot that says GO or NO-GO on your flight every 30 minutes. What Rank let in this week"},"author_id":"81458095","created_at":"2026-11-28T12:57:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126661694097121308"],"id":"2126661694097121308","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":88,"like_count":0,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"A Grok Bot that says GO or NO-GO on your flight every 30 minutes. What Rank let in this week https://t.co/KGuXnH2NrO","url":"https://x.com/bugatsinho/status/2126661694097121308"},{"author_id":"1180424580944543744","created_at":"2026-11-28T12:54:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126661049541918805"],"id":"2126661049541918805","in_reply_to_user_id":"1951111252111138817","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126562215478386754","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@DimaVRF @bot @Muse Depends on the job\n\nGrok @bot is better for my daily stuff, inbox and cards. @muse is better for shopping and it never runs out\n\nI keep both","url":"https://x.com/bruno_munhoz/status/2126661049541918805"},{"author_id":"1180424580944543744","created_at":"2026-11-28T12:53:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126660878816997475"],"id":"2126660878816997475","in_reply_to_user_id":"11400632","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126477991802962343","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@aohare @bot @Muse I need both for different jobs\n\nGrok @bot is my daily driver for inbox and card checks. @muse does a lot of the shopping and never hits the limit\n\nThat's why I keep the $30 + $16 combo","url":"https://x.com/bruno_munhoz/status/2126660878816997475"},{"article":{"title":"AI Daily, Nov 28: Anthropic denies Claude sabotage, OpenAI countersues, banned Blackwells in China"},"author_id":"1508034028670181376","created_at":"2026-11-28T12:51:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126660244738625798"],"id":"2126660244738625798","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":267,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/vqRUCMX6XA","url":"https://x.com/moocat999/status/2126660244738625798"},{"article":{"title":"Day 3, the bar was still at 35%. Usage is three numbers multiplied"},"author_id":"380820651","created_at":"2026-11-28T12:36:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126656595933470860"],"id":"2126656595933470860","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":480,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/DdGtynjaPL","url":"https://x.com/Leoskie_L/status/2126656595933470860"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2126648387433005056"]},"author_id":"1737385370831192065","created_at":"2026-11-28T12:21:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126652773525770465"],"id":"2126652773525770465","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":142,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Hit my grok bot usage limit mid-task. Again. Might be a skill issue at this point.\n\nInstalled @HeyLingerAI out of curiousity, since I got notified yesterday that they released their Linger beta.\n\nThis is a genuine share, not a paid promo. lol\n\nLinger runs fully local on your PC — https://t.co/NCpv3OKdFG","url":"https://x.com/venthewise/status/2126652773525770465"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-11-28T12:16:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126651369390064085"],"id":"2126651369390064085","in_reply_to_user_id":"4322799373","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126651254009135208","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@MiRajeshPatil @alexmichael Grok Bot is xAI’s AI teammate product. Each Bot gets its own persistent cloud computer with a browser, files, and terminal. You message it like a colleague, hand it real tasks, and it works inside your apps and websites—signing in, clicking around, finishing jobs end-to-end—while","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2126651369390064085"},{"author_id":"1398565994042376195","created_at":"2026-11-28T12:09:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126649666922045686"],"id":"2126649666922045686","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":215,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126623385493061864","type":"quoted"}],"text":"If you’re not using Grok Bot to manage your social media, you’re doing it wrong. \n\nWhether you make videos, write threads or share tutorials, Grok Bot can help. I’ve built a few bots, and the three I use the most are Viral Hooks, X Growth Assistant and Algorithm Change Radar.\n\nI https://t.co/XsDk5H9wKM","url":"https://x.com/karatademada/status/2126649666922045686"},{"author_id":"1180424580944543744","created_at":"2026-11-28T12:07:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126649053589148144"],"id":"2126649053589148144","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":92,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Grok @bot gets my inbox, card checks and deal hunts\n\n@muse gets the groceries and Walmart\n\nI asked them to split it so they stop pinging me twice\n\nWhich one would you trust with your inbox?","url":"https://x.com/bruno_munhoz/status/2126649053589148144"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["16_2126643247178977280"]},"author_id":"2094906115314135040","created_at":"2026-11-28T11:43:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126643256981102819"],"id":"2126643256981102819","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":42,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"ELON JUST TOLD 5.6M PEOPLE HOW TO USE GROK BOT.\nOne bot doing everything \"starts dropping some of the balls\".\n\nSo don't build one bot. Build a team:\n\n01 / Chief of Staff → merges everything into a 5-line morning brief\n02 / Inbox → sorts mail, drafts replies, never sends\n03 / https://t.co/Jzm4BuvOfK","url":"https://x.com/NeuN0mad/status/2126643256981102819"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126642935907172352"]},"author_id":"2549824448","created_at":"2026-11-28T11:43:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126643031126245636"],"id":"2126643031126245636","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":391,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Grok Bot just got a few useful upgrades\n\nIn the last few days the team shipped:\n\n- book flights, hotels and rental cars right in chat\n- up to 50% more usage for routines\n- new connectors for Google Ads, Google Analytics and QuickBooks\n- smarter Slack bots\n\nThe one that stands out https://t.co/ae8gqwYFeA","url":"https://x.com/z0renX/status/2126643031126245636"},{"author_id":"1959456446271377408","created_at":"2026-11-28T11:32:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126640428393156905"],"id":"2126640428393156905","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":481,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":2},"text":"How to build a 1-person company using Grok Bot\n\n1. Get Grok Bot\nCreate your account and start your first Bot.\n\n2. Hire your first AI employee\nGive it ONE job. Example: a Sales Bot that finds leads, researches them, writes outreach and updates your CRM.\n\n3. Connect your tools","url":"https://x.com/DeepStarts/status/2126640428393156905"},{"author_id":"1698356339364302848","created_at":"2026-11-28T11:23:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126637999123308971"],"id":"2126637999123308971","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":483,"like_count":11,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126569877221621795","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Rent compute to Google, run Neon in SpaceX datacenter, use neon in grok bot\n\nThere, problem solved https://t.co/A544PcfBHf","url":"https://x.com/scottstts/status/2126637999123308971"},{"author_id":"718993","created_at":"2026-11-28T11:07:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126634192096112717"],"id":"2126634192096112717","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":191,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Six months in our new build, the ventilation filters were filthy 😅\n\nSo I made a Grok @bot that tracks every filter swap, service and warranty deadline, with reminders on our family calendar.\n\nNow it's a free template. It asks about your home and appliances first, then builds","url":"https://x.com/mahdi/status/2126634192096112717"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126632987252940800"]},"author_id":"1581979406519750656","created_at":"2026-11-28T11:03:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126632991434703278"],"id":"2126632991434703278","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":230,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Singularity Watch, Day 44 — November 28, 2026\n\nScott Aaronson Says AI Labs Will Soon Release a Breakthrough in Theoretical Cryptanalysis, Hackers Breach the Air Force's Cloud One Platform, and Anthropic Denies That Claude Sabotages Users' Work\n\nCryptography: A Breakthrough https://t.co/U9zjtpYelZ","url":"https://x.com/AstrohackerLabs/status/2126632991434703278"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["7_2126629613065355264"]},"author_id":"2111431780788051968","created_at":"2026-11-28T10:49:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126629633403592812"],"id":"2126629633403592812","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":27,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2123121401762918718","type":"quoted"}],"text":"One Grok tip, every morning at breakfast\nYour Bot books your trip: flights, hotels, rental cars. Ask it to compare first. Pick one, check the total, then approve.\nhttps://t.co/f3uxl3oRRT\nUnofficial · Not affiliated with SpaceXSI #xAI\nDownload Grok Bot (paid plan), link in bio https://t.co/uBQF6R121Y","url":"https://x.com/BotnBreakfast/status/2126629633403592812"},{"author_id":"1643695629665722379","created_at":"2026-11-28T10:45:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126628418519433402"],"id":"2126628418519433402","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":4125,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":4},"text":"🚨 BREAKING: Grok Bot can now book your flights, hotels and rental cars inside the chat.\n\nThe Grok Bot team shipped all of this in the last few days:\n\n→ book a whole trip in one conversation\n→ new QuickBooks connector for your books\n→ Google Ads and Google Analytics connectors","url":"https://x.com/alex_prompter/status/2126628418519433402"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2126622595239862272"]},"author_id":"1548563461680005120","created_at":"2026-11-28T10:22:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126622702718849504"],"id":"2126622702718849504","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1043,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126569877221621795","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Elon just called rival AI labs \"slowpokes.\" 14 minutes earlier he said one of them, Google, wants to rent more of his GPUs.\n\nThis morning, his own posts (UTC):\n→ 06:47, a fan: \"I wouldn't be surprised if Google actually ends up buying more SI compute from SpaceX than Anthropic\" https://t.co/7GpzWHSjN1 https://t.co/JGRVdCYsu2","url":"https://x.com/Marko_Poly/status/2126622702718849504"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126621917415424000"]},"author_id":"2054327928226484224","created_at":"2026-11-28T10:19:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126621939653570595"],"id":"2126621939653570595","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":56,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Grok Bot 的开源替代品，服务端、适配器和 CLI 都用 Rust 写。部署在自己的 VPS 上。用户只和主 Bot 对话，由它把任务分给 Developer、Researcher、Inbox 这类专职 Bot，每个 Bot 背后接的是 Claude Code、Codex 或 Pi 的 CLI，换 agent 只改一个薄适配器。\n\nhttps://t.co/0Khdmnzjev https://t.co/ZD3nHeK9dq","url":"https://x.com/GYLQ520/status/2126621939653570595"}],"includes":{"media":[{"media_key":"3_2126661384192536579","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HYNrQupWMAMXNnm.jpg"},{"media_key":"3_2126661420204818433","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HYNrS0zWAAEWZyC.jpg"},{"media_key":"13_2126648387433005056","preview_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2126648387433005056/img/eVV-PUlG02_G1x9m.jpg","type":"video"},{"media_key":"16_2126643247178977280","preview_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/HYNaxBAWEAALNEo.jpg","type":"animated_gif"},{"media_key":"3_2126642935907172352","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HYNae5bXQAARz2l.jpg"},{"media_key":"3_2126632987252940800","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HYNRbzzW4AAMjRU.jpg"},{"media_key":"7_2126629613065355264","preview_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/ext_tw_video_thumb/2126629613065355264/pu/img/NkXItan4YFTDf0kH.jpg","type":"video"},{"media_key":"13_2126622595239862272","preview_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2126622595239862272/img/3dqeaLiCYmxj17wi.jpg","type":"video"},{"media_key":"3_2126621917415424000","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HYNHXdcbQAAkmiJ.png"}],"users":[{"id":"2116504491616866304","name":"DFYBots","profile_image_url":"